{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/c/09cafc0af7e6d6ff4eb129ca50e44203fd607554.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" /> are not <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/a/23a11914dbfd848c0ccae0c26006b82fdaaae0bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x-\\frac{1}{y}}{y-\\frac{1}{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"46\" height=\"49\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/4/f449e7c23f2563731edcbb2b813f38e57bc5fb66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\frac{x}{y} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\frac{y}{x}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }\\frac{x}{y}-\\frac{y}{x} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } xy-\\frac{1}{xy}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"450\" height=\"40\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiply the expression by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/7/5d716d9b241c9d805fcbbca96f7cfaf4b1b0197a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{xy}{xy}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"22\" height=\"36\" /> to get rid of the fractional <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Numerator\" title=\"Numerator\">numerator</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Denominator\" title=\"Denominator\">denominator</a>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/7/c37a320bf611f271f37bb275c6b7e6ad6da66f84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2y-x}{xy^2-y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"62\" height=\"42\" />. This can be <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factoring\" title=\"Factoring\">factored</a> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce343eadb91f048881985186e684f294ee351df3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x(xy-1)}{y(xy-1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"78\" height=\"43\" />. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/7/097dc18daa85c6c33e15fc629fbbb8a64252d5e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> terms cancel out, leaving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/e/77ede72de36d876223a3e9b89115d8de41b8e41e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}, \\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"46\" height=\"36\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b